${COLOR_BOLD}DESCRIPTION${COLOR_RESET}
  Checks that silkscreen graphics are visually consistent:
    ${COLOR_GREEN}•${COLOR_RESET} All silkscreen line widths are the same
    ${COLOR_GREEN}•${COLOR_RESET} All reference-designator (U1, C3, …) text sizes are the same

